ory and methods::Education::4.1.1 (4) The significance of educational policies, including policies of selection, marketisation and privatisation, and policies to achieve greater equality of opportunity or outcome, for an understanding of the structure, role, impact and experience of and access to education; the impact of globalisation on educational policy"},{"k":"ppp-soc-7192-background:0c21fe0a6b4374b2eade","f":"What is an academy in England?","b":"A state-funded school independent of local authority control","t":["PPP::Spec::AQA_SOC_4.1.1_b4","PPP::AQA::7192","PPP::Deck::atomic","PPP::Paper::Paper1","PPP::Topic::education","PPP::Class::background"],"p":"AQA A-level Sociology 7192 – Background knowledge::Paper 1: Education with theory and methods::Education::4.1.1 (4) The significance of educational policies, including policies of selection, marketisation and privatisation, and policies to achieve greater equality of opportunity or outcome, for an understanding of the structure, role, impact and experience of and access to education; the impact of globalisation on educational policy"},{"k":"ppp-soc-7192-background:81a4f2c5d2f3e5bb4f37","f":"What is gatekeeper access in school research?","b":"Permission from a person controlling access to participants","t":["PPP::Spec::AQA_SOC_4.1.2_b1","PPP::AQA::7192","PPP::Deck::atomic","PPP::Paper::Paper1","PPP::Topic::methods-in-context","PPP::Class::background"],"p":"AQA A-level Sociology 7192 – Background knowledge::Paper 1: Education with theory and methods::Methods in context::4.1.2 (1) Students must be able to apply sociological research methods to the study of education"},{"k":"ppp-soc-7192-background:bae470fbcdf4e78213b4","f":"What is operationalisation?","b":"Turning an abstract concept into measurable indicators","t":["PPP::Spec::AQA_SOC_4.1.3_b1","PPP::AQA::7192","PPP::Deck::atomic","PPP::Paper::Paper1","PPP::Topic::theory-and-methods","PPP::Class::background"],"p":"AQA A-level Sociology 7192 – Background knowledge::